  "content": "<h3><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>此項目無限期暫停。未來更新未知。</strong></span></h3>\n<p>描述</p>\n<p>簡單資源包能讓Goety的門徒變得不那麼可怕。</p>\n<p>兼容Apollyon。</p>\n<p>模型略顯粗糙和僵硬，我已經盡力了。</p>\n<p>需要\"Entity Model Features\"模塊</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">門徒</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1332976/description_ca9e1764-4a3c-4ab1-9d2c-8c58b6a6daa1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"832\" height=\"652\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#169179\">幽靈</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1332976/description_df8e6f44-f78b-475f-89b9-8ccc79cf3d8f.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"844\" height=\"632\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">阿波利恩</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1332976/description_7f97a01c-dd4b-48fc-9641-c8ec2015fd71.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"740\" height=\"548\"></p>\n<div>此資源包為Goety模塊製作。<div>&nbsp;</div>修改門徒模型，並兼容Goety：啟示錄。</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>[動畫部分來源歸屬]</div>\n<div><br>本資源包的動畫部分基於Emmie_4的作品\"Cute Mob Models Resource Pack\"所做的修改。<br>原始專案：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/cute-mob-models-resource-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/cute-mob-models-resource-pack</a><br>根據GNU通用公共授權版本3重新分發。</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>部分動畫受到FreshLX的Fresh Animations的啟發。</div>\n<div><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/fresh-animations\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/fresh-animations</a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>",
